name: String, displayed at the bottom-left corner of the screen

requiredProcessor: String, the index key name of the processor for this event

duration: Number, indicates the duration of the event

delay: Number, the delay time before the event takes effect

description: String, displayed at the top of the screen (only shown during the delay period, keep it as concise as possible; can be an empty string "")

nameFaceColor: List, the face color of name
descriptionFaceColor: List, the face color of description